Metadata-Version: 2.1
Name: bithuman
Version: 2.11.20
Summary: bitHuman avatar runtime SDK (binary wheels only; this sdist refuses on unsupported platforms)
Home-page: https://bithuman.ai
Author: bitHuman
Author-email: hello@bithuman.ai
License: Commercial
Requires-Python: >=3.10,<3.15
Description-Content-Type: text/plain

This source distribution does not build. `bithuman` ships pre-compiled
wheels for Linux x86_64, Linux aarch64 and macOS 14+ arm64. On any other
platform this sdist is what pip finds, and it refuses with an explicit
message naming your platform and the supported set -- so that a
`pip install bithuman` on an unsupported platform FAILS instead of quietly
resolving a months-old release whose wheel happens to match your tags.
